  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwaka wamuchisatu wamwanta wakuPeresi Kirusi, amwekesheli chuma chimu kudi Danyeli atumbawu nawu Beleteshaza. Chumochu chadiŋi chalala, yadiŋi njita yeneni. Yena welukili mwaya chumochu, welukili mwaya chimwenu ochu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamafuku owu ami Danyeli nadilili nyilungu yisatu yamukuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinadiili yakudya yakutiyisha kuwahaku, mbiji navinyu hiyahitili kukanwa kamuku, hela kuwaya manji nihanti nehi, chiŋa nyilungu yisatu yamukuma yinamani dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwifuku dakakweji kakusambila damakumi ayedi nakawana, chinadiŋi nakwimana kuchi kumu chakaloŋa muneni, yowu Hidekeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hinukufumbula mesu ami nami nitali, hikudi muntu navwali ihina dadiwahi, mumbunda wakasamu wuru wakuUfwazi wakoseka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mujimba windi wudi neyi berili, chifu chindi neyi chamwekanaŋa nzaji, mesu indi neyi manoŋu akesi, makasindi ninyendu yindi yamwekana neyi wuneŋu washilindindi, izu damazu indi neyi izu daluntu lwaluvulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami Danyeli namweni chimwenu ochu kanka wami; muloŋa antu nadiŋi nawu hiyamweni chimwenu ochuku; ilaŋa kwayiholokeleli kuzaala kwakweni, hiyakutemuka nakubatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi nasheli kanka wami, hinukumona chimwenu ichi cheneni, mudami himwasheli Ŋovuku; kuwaha kwami kunadiŋi naku kubalumuka nikutoka, hinadiŋi nawa cheŋi naŋovuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, natiyili izu damazu indi; chinatiyili izu damazu indi hinukudimbuka chamesu heseki namutulu twatweni, mesu ami atala heseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutala, chikasa hichikunkunka, hichikunhindwisha hinukufukama kwakwila nakwati nimakasa heseki, iku nidi nakuzaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋila nindi, Eyi Danyeli, eyi muntu wasweja kukeŋewa, ilukaku mazu inukukeŋa kuhosha naneyi, imanaku zulumba; muloŋa ami anantemeshi dehi kudeyi. Chananlejiyi izu idi, hinukwimana nakuzaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuŋila nindi, Danyeli, bayi wutiya womaku, muloŋa kufumisha kwifuku datachi diwashili muchima weyi kukwiluka nikukudizoza kumesu aNzambi yeyi, mazu eyi ayitiyili. Ninami nenzi dehi hansaŋu yamazu eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa kalamba ketuŋa dawaPeresi wadikaŋili nanami mafuku makumi ayedi nefuku dimu; kutala Mikeli, kalamba wumu wahadi atulamba abadika, hakwinza nakunkwashaku, namushiyi kwenoku hamu nawanyanta amuPeresi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu nenzi dehi nikuleji, kulonda wiluki yakamona muza wenu kumafuku akukuminina; chimwenu ochu muchidi mafuku amavulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chahosheliyi nanami mwaya mazu awa, hinukutalisha mesu ami heseki, niikala nikamama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutala wumu wafwana neyi anyana kawantu hakukunka kunyivumbu yami; hinukwasama mukanwa kami hinukuhosha, hinukumwila wemeni kumesu ami nami, Eyi nkaka yami, nachimwenu ochu nyisoŋu yinanwani dehi, hinikweti nawa cheŋi Ŋovuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi nkaka yami, ami kambuŋevi nukutwesha kuhosha ŋahi naneyi nkaka yami? muloŋa ami henohu mudami himwasheli nawa cheŋi Ŋovuku, himwasheli nawa cheŋi muuya ku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikukunkunka nawa cheŋi wumu wamwekana neyi muntu, hakunkolesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila nindi, Eyi muntu wasweja kukeŋewa, bayi wutiya womaku; kuwunda kwikali naneyi; kolaku, eŋa kolaku. Chahosheliyi nanami nitiya niŋovu, nami, Eyi nkaka yami, hoshaŋa; muloŋa wunankoleshi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila nindi, Eyi wuneluki yinenjili kudeyi? Ichi dinu hinukufunta nakulwisha nakalamba kawaPeresi. Chinukuya kalamba kawaHeleni wakenza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa nukukuleja yanasonekuwu munsona yansaŋu yalala. Kwosi wankwashaŋa kulwa nawenawaku, chiŋa kalamba kenu Mikeli hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.10.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
